    "prompt": "Use case stylized-concept. Production original fan-made detailed pixel-art 2D sprites of one adult female CAMOUFLAGE / SNIPER SKULL from Metal Gear Solid V The Phantom Pain. Faithful game model: very pale gray bald scalp, black headset, dark monocular scope over her RIGHT eye with strap around scalp, severe face without gas mask, high olive armored collar, cropped olive shoulder and upper arm armor, tactical olive chest panels covering breasts, pale gray abdomen with dark parasite streaks, closed dark tactical briefs and belt with olive pouches, black knee guards, tall olive combat boots, gloves. Slender athletic adult soldier proportions, clinical combat depiction not erotic, no nudity. Long dark scoped sniper rifle, no stone armor and no male Mist respirator. EXACT 4columns×4rows16 full-body poses. All faceRIGHT side orthographic view. Crisp restrained pixel clusters. Flat#FF00FF magenta background, thin cyan boundary grid. ALL silhouettes including the long rifle must occupy central60% of each square cell, leaving20% empty magenta left/right. Same anatomical scale and groundbaseline. Row1 four distinct idle vigilant head/scope phases. Row2 four walking steps with truly alternating legs. Row3 four firing phases: standing ready, kneeling aim, kneeling fire small muzzle flash, recovering kneel. Row4 four parasite camouflage reaction phases: brief recoil, low evasive crouch, stand with faint cyan outline, normal ready. Keep her fully opaque/readable in ALL frames, no transparency except background, no missing limbs. No labels, text, scenery, floor shadows, watermark, duplicate translations. Entire rifle and body fit each cell.",
